      <p class="proposal-kicker">Slow travel, locally rooted</p>
      <h2 id="welcome-en">A village stay shaped by place</h2>
      <p>Mandirgarh brings together a seasonal waterbody, open scrub, farmland, woodland edges and old sacred places within a walkable landscape. The proposed pilot is for travellers who value patient observation, simple hospitality and respectful encounters with local life.</p>
      <p>One pre-booked group of up to four adults would stay at a time. A separate, non-residential school field day could host one age-banded group of up to 15 students with school-designated teachers or chaperones.</p>
    </div>
