    <div class="card"><p class="proposal-kicker">Simple by design</p><h2 id="stay-en">What the proposed stay would include</h2><ul class="check-list"><li>A clean room in a local host’s home</li><li>Simple local meals agreed around dietary needs</li><li>Safe drinking water, clean bedding and mosquito protection</li><li>Locally guided walks within permitted areas</li><li>One adult homestay group at a time; school batches are separate supervised day programmes</li></ul><p class="muted">This would not be a resort. Comfort, safety, quiet and genuine local benefit would take priority over luxury.</p></div>
  </section>
</div>

<div data-language-panel="hi" lang="hi" hidden>
  <section class="section stay-preview" aria-labelledby="stay-hi">
